y Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration:_Attack_Roll_or_Ability_Check\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration: Attack Roll or Ability Check\">Improved Bardic Inspiration: Attack Roll or Ability Check</a></span></dt><dd>Add a +1d12 bonus to your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack roll</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration:_Saving_Throw\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp/60px-Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp/80px-Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Bardic_Roll_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration:_Saving_Throw\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw\">Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw</a></span></dt><dd>Add a +1d12 bonus to your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throw</a>.</dd></dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, this condition also grants the Bardic Inspiration resource and reactions of a d6 Bardic Inspiration. Using one of the reactions expends the Bardic Inspiration charge but does not remove the Improved Bardic Inspiration condition, leaving non-bard characters with an empty, nonreplenishable Bardic Inspiration charge slot until the condition is expended.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Improved_Bardic_Inspiration\">Sources of Improved Bardic Inspiration</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/45px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/60px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>BARDIC_INSPIRATION</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Bardic_Inspiration\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/ima